COMPILATION OF: E51C

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E51C

   1 a 0000 E51C:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-51/P1] COMPOUND dividend over a VARIABLE divisor: z = (a
   4 a 0006      + b) / c.  The P071A add law (LHLD a / XCHG / LHLD b / DAD D)
   5 a 0006      leaves the sum in HL; the [C089] parking shape then applies to
   6 a 0006      the SUM: H-C-park predicts ...DAD D / PUSH H / LHLD c / POP D
   7 a 0006      / CALL ?ID22N / SHLD z, ONE store.  H-C-temp: DR materialises
   8 a 0006      the sum into a temp cell (an extra SHLD/LHLD pair).  H-C-
   9 a 0006      refuse: DR refuses a parenthesised dividend. */
  10 c 0006   dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  11 c 0006   z = (a + b) / c;
  12 a 0019 end E51C;

CODE SIZE = 001C
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38BC
END  COMPILATION
